{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52063","headline":"游山寺 · 王绩","name":"游山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赤城仙观啓，青山梵宇裁。\n中天疏宝座，半景出香台。\n雁翼金桥转，鱼鳞石道回。\n经文连树刻，仙影对岩开。\n别有迷方者，终慙无碍才。\n抠衣只杖锡，敛袂谒浮盃。\n暂识𡺸闍岭，联询劫烬灰\n持花龙女至，献菓象王来。\n讲坐真乘阐，谈筵外法催。\n方希除八难，从此涤三灾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}